<div class="container-fluid" id="News">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-md-offset-2"><br/>
      <h2 style="font-size: 3.8em; font-weight:bold;">Make your autoshop management <br>easier than ever.</h2>
      <h3 class="sm-none" style="font-size: 2.3em; padding-bottom:20px;text-align:left;padding-left:100px;font-weight:bold;">
      Software that is simple to use <br>
      <br> Only takes seconds to setup <br>
      <br> Will help your busines grow</h3>
        <ul style="padding-top:40px;list-style-type:none;text-align:left;">
          <li style="display:inline;padding-right:60px;">
          <%= link_to "Try for Free", signup_path(plan: @basic_plan.id), class: 'btn btn-default btn-lg' %></li>
          <li style="display:inline;margin-top: 100px;">
          <%= link_to "Request a Demo", new_contact_path, class: 'btn btn-default btn-lg' %>
          </li>
          <br/>
        </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div style="background-color:#B22222;" class="container-fluid">
  <div class="row">
    <div style="text-align:left;padding:0px 25px 0px 25px;height:300px;" class="col-lg-8 col-lg-offset-2 col-md-10 col-md-offset-1 sm-none">
      <h2 style="text-align:left">What We Offer</h2>
      <h2 style="padding: 0px 0px 20px 0px;">Motivware is a very simple tool to use and has powerful features
      and only takes seconds to set up. Start today for free by signing up and inviting the rest of your team.
      We offer an all-in-one tool for your autoshop business. Designed to assist auto-mechanic service companies
      with customer relationships and business processes.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div style="padding:25px;margin:0px 50px 0px 50px;background-color:#FFF" class="container-fluid">

  <div class="row">

    <div class="well space landingfour landingtwo col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4 ">
      <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-tasks landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Work Orders</h3>
        <h4 class="landtext">Help assign tasks and keep
        your team organized. Track
        what is completed and what
        still needs done. </h4>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="well space col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
      <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-road landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Vehicle Roadmap</h3>
        <h4 class="landtext">Keep track of all your vehicles. Help alert customers of common
        vehicle problems.</h4>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="well space landingtwo col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
      <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-pencil landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Invoice Generation</h3>
        <h4 class="landtext">Generate invoices and contain a history
        of records. Customize your
        invoice to suite your needs</h4>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="well space col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
      <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-search landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Part Finder</h3>
        <h4 class="landtext">Search for parts across
        the web. Find the best deals to
        help everyone save money. Ensure
        your finding the right part for job.</h4>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="row">

    <div class="well space landingfour landingtwo col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4 ">
      <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-equalizer landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Repair Estimates</h3>
        <h4 class="landtext">Build service repair estimates for
        your customers. Send the estimates by
        print or email. </h4>
      </div>
    </div>

  <div class="well space col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
    <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
      <i class="fa fa-mobile landicon"></i>
      <h3 class="landhead" style="text-align:center;">Mobile Friendly</h3>
      <h4 class="landtext" class="landsmall">Use with your phone or tablet from
        anywhere with Wifi. Stay up to date
        with all work being done from home. </h4>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="well space landingtwo col-xl-1 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
    <div style="font-size:3em;text-align:center;">
      <i class="fa fa-users landicon"></i>
      <h3 style="text-align:center;">Customer Portal</h3>
      <h4 class="landtext">Allow customers to submit service requests and
      view the status of their vehicles.
      </h4>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="well space col-xl-2 col-lg-2 col-md-4 col-sm-4">
    <div style="font-size:3em; text-align:center;">
      <i class="fa fa-database landicon"></i>
        <h3 style="text-align:center;">Data Normalization</h3>
      <h4 class="landtext">Start keeping your records organized.
      Save a history of everything your shop
      has been working on.</h4>
    </div>
  </div>

  </div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="container-fluid" id="SignUp">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-4 col-sm-offset-1">
          <h3 style="color:white;font-size: 2.0em;">Subscribe to our newsletter</h3>

          <%= form_for @visitor do |f| %>
            <%= f.text_field :email, label: false, :placeholder => 'Your email address...', class: 'form-control' %>
            <br/>
            <%= f.submit "Subscribe", :class => "btn btn-default btn-lg" %>
          <% end %>
          </br></br></br></br>
      <span style="color:#FFF;font-size: .8em;" class="glyphicon glyphicon-envelope fa-md">
      <a style="font-size: 1.0em;color:#FFF;text-decoration:none;" href="mailto:support@motivware.com">
      support@motivware.com
      </a></span>
    </div>
    <div class="sm-none" class="col-sm-4" >
        <ul style="margin-right:100px;" class="footer-nav">
          <li><%= link_to "FAQ", faq_path, class: "footer-nav-link" %></li>
          <li><%= link_to "Privacy Policy", new_contact_path, class: "footer-nav-link" %></li>
          <li><%= link_to "Terms Of Use", new_contact_path, class: "footer-nav-link" %></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="container-fluid text-center">
  <a href="#myPage" title="To Top">
    <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-up"></span>
  </a>
  <p>Copyright &copy; Motivware 2019. All Rights Reserved</a></p>
</footer>
